    -- addon:data.affix_text.shield_block_also_absorbs_value_65_value:text
    ["Shield Block also absorbs @value@65%@value@ @range@[40%-200%]@range@ of your Attack Power for 10 sec. When the shield breaks, a tidal surge knocks back non-boss enemies around you (Does not stack)"] = "Schildblock absorbiert zudem 10 Sek. lang Schaden in Höhe von @value@65%@value@ @range@[40%-200%]@range@ Eurer Angriffskraft. Bricht der Schild, stößt eine Flutwelle Feinde um Euch herum zurück (außer Bossen) (Nicht stapelbar)",
